## Generación de candidatos

```python
from itertools import product

p2  = [0x0a,0x2a,0x57]
p3  = [0x49,0x5b,0x73]
p4  = [0x16,0xde]
p6  = [0x09,0x89]
p12 = [0x16,0xde]
p13 = [0xc2,0xf4]

for a,b,c,d,e,f in product(p2,p3,p4,p6,p12,p13):
    key = bytes([
        0x74,0xc5,a,b,c,0x84,d,0x90,
        0xef,0x67,0x5a,0x02,e,f,0x69,0xcd
    ])

    print(key.hex())
```

Total:

